s2650sv: SystemVerilog Signetics 2650A / 2650B CPU, cycle-for-cycle re-implementation of sgs2650
(SystemVerilog by Rodimus).

Upstream attribution
--------------------
  sgs2650 (VHDL): "Signetics 2650A CPU", DO 4/2018, TEMlib (dev@temlib.org, Grabulosaure); the core in
  MiSTer-devel/Arcadia_MiSTer (rtl/s2650/). Fleet copy (Galaxian / Pacman / Centipede / SpaceInvaders) adds two
  fixes (fetch after an I/O access from IAR as a read; ZBRR / ZBSR indirect), reproduced here.

  License: the sgs2650 sources carry NO licence text (only "Please send any bug report or remark to:
  dev@temlib.org"). The terms of the upstream Arcadia_MiSTer repository apply to that code; they have not been
  confirmed here. Until they are, treat s2650sv as carrying whatever terms sgs2650 / Arcadia_MiSTer carry.

Attribution / licence notice
----------------------------
The attribution and licence terms in this file are our best reading of the upstream sources. Where an upstream gives
no licence (or its terms are unclear), the code is offered under whatever terms that upstream carries. If anything
here is wrong, incomplete or not what an author intended, please contact the maintainer (open an issue on this
repository) and it will be corrected promptly.
